# OS junk
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Editor and IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Logs
*.log

# Local harness state; never commit session or worktree data.
.claude/

# Packaged archives are never committed; GitHub builds the release archives.
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
dist/

# Generated audit reports from dogfooding the suite on itself: every auditor
# writes <name>audit.md at the repo root (lint suite-registry checks each one).
/*audit.md

# Eval run output from scripts/eval.sh (claude plugin eval results).
# tests/lint-selftest.sh removes this exact line; keep it as written.
evals/results/
